Evidence: capability status CLI behavior and F002 acceptance.

The status output carries `pending_probes` separately from capability `status`.
Capability status is limited to the closed set ready, needs_setup, blocked,
not_installed, optional. PENDING is a probe-state meaning the probe declaration
needs implementation or cannot yet resolve; it is not a capability status and
does not by itself downgrade a capability to blocked.

Verified by the F002 implementation and tests committed before close-out.
